        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Matt Willis, Anthony Raneri, Jack O'Shea, Nick Ghanbarian, Chris Guglielmo\n- Bands: Busted, Bayside\n- Roles: singer-songwriter, television presenter, actor, bassist, vocalist, lead vocalist, guitarist, lead guitarist, drummer\n- Products: Don't Let It Go to Waste\n- Places: New York City\n\nFacts:\n- Matt Willis was born on 8 May 1983.\n- Bayside is an American rock band from New York City that was formed in 2000.\n- Matt Willis is an English singer-songwriter, television presenter, and actor who was previously known as Mattie Jay.\n- Matt Willis is best known as the bassist and one of the vocalists of the pop punk band Busted.\n- Bayside currently consists of lead vocalist and guitarist Anthony Raneri, lead guitarist Jack O'Shea, bassist Nick Ghanbarian, and drummer Chris Guglielmo.\n- Matt Willis released his debut solo album, \"Don't Let It Go to Waste,\" on 20 November 2006.\n- Matt Willis's album \"Don't Let It Go to Waste\" included three top 20 singles.",
